nt\">ROG Sweater</b> PHIÊN BẢN EVA </h2>\n                    <!-- <img  class=\"icon_eva_edition\" src=\"https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/71D0D4C5-49A1-42FC-87B8-BB9C0317A2D2/v1/img/icon_eva_edition.svg\" alt=\"\"> -->\n                    <h3 style=\"font-family:Arial !important\">\n                        Đường viền cổ được may chống nhăn<br>\n                        In thoáng khí&nbsp;&nbsp;·&nbsp;Được làm từ vải cotton&nbsp;&nbsp;·&nbsp;Thiết kế lấy cảm hứng từ EVA\n                    </h3>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section id=\"EVA-Ports\" class=\"product-section\">\n            <div style=\"font-family:Arial !important\" class=\"product-content\">\n                <div style=\"font-family:Arial !important\" class=\"bg\">\n                    <img  class=\"bg_ports_01\" src=\"https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/71D0D4C5-49A1-42FC-87B8-BB9C0317A2D2/v1/img/bg_ports_01.svg\" alt=\"\">\n                    <img  class=\"bg_ports_02\" src=\"https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/71D0D4C5-49A1-42FC-87B8-BB9C0317A2D2/v1/img/bg_ports_02.png\" alt=\"\">\n                    <img  class=\"pd\" src=\"https://dlcdnwebimgs.asus.com/files/media/71D0D4C5-49A1-42FC-87B8-BB9C0317A2D2/v1/img/ports_pd.png\" alt=\"ROG Sweater EVA Edition (back view)\">\n                </div>\n                <!-- <div style=\"font-family:Arial !important\" class=\"maintitle\">\n                    <h2 style=\"font-family:Arial !important\">THIẾT KẾ LẤY CẢM HỨNG TỪ EVA</h2>\n                    <div style=\"font-family:Arial !important\" class=\"info\">ROG RX Red and RX Blue Optical Mechanical Switches offer consistent, wobble-free keystrokes with a superfast 1 ms response and 100-million-keystroke lifespan. These premium switches have a hollow-square stem design and they feature embedded RGB LEDs providing all-round per-key lighting.​</div>\n                </div> -->\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- <sec